    <string name="quiet_title">When to keep quiet</string>
    <string name="quiet_body">Outside its hours the server shuts down completely: no port, no WiFi kept awake. Nothing is lost — Health Connect keeps collecting on its own, and the first read of the morning reads backwards.</string>
